Package: drMultiOutITR
Title: Doubly Robust Mixed-Outcome Individualized Treatment Ranking
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Chathura", "Siriwardhana", email = "cksiri@hawaii.edu", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Doubly robust conditional distributional outcome estimation
    and covariance-scaled rank aggregation for individualized treatment
    selection using observational data. A unified fit-and-predict interface
    supports multiple treatments and mixed continuous, ordinal, binary, and
    censored survival outcomes. Flexible learners and cross-fitted nuisance
    estimates are available; causal interpretation requires identification
    and estimation assumptions.
